                                                          "A tucked receipt\nrecords a\ngreenhouse\nemergency repair.\nThe payer is",
                                                          "Sterling, not\nSlush Estates. It\npredates his first\nproperty",
                                                          "purchase. The\nfigure is modest\nbeside later\ninvoices. The\nbottom",
                                                          "says: Save what\ncan still grow. No\nadvertising mark\naccompanies the",
